        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "报道里的伤，还是髂胫束和外侧半月板。具体开哪一刀，各家还不一致。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "65647e9e416cb8ef0fedcd296fec4de4d0dd395be8ae65cb1030b56a4b7bc4a7",
      "words_sha256": "15ddaa5839d559ba08daaff7cfa81820e636eea2adfa280d7f1cbb05c99df612"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:cd3fda39d40c4583a0c5dc3f6197f2bab6adcaa6def8f55bb9c6878af9ab63bb",
      "request_id": "cd3fda39d40c4583a0c5dc3f6197f2bab6adcaa6def8f55bb9c6878af9ab63bb",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "841acda47960495c2d045bb42e269308",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "辛纳退到第二。他在世界第一的位置上，一共待了九十五周。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "a4c3ede582e6da2d9529f27b5e0b5ef65f9d7e5347854b46757319efb685a508",
      "words_sha256": "a2d61224f9275ea7f6c5b9f6284b3d8e149abe111705b9fecd59f151ecd629a7"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:efa3da53dfc8bc7d06fcfcd34f151abce4d2c0a807c728a55108c90dfc75cf1d",
      "request_id": "efa3da53dfc8bc7d06fcfcd34f151abce4d2c0a807c728a55108c90dfc75cf1d",
      "request": {
