        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这意味着，去年秋天维也纳、巴黎、年终总决赛三个冠军的积分，他一分都保不住。十一月二号，兹维列夫登上世界第一。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "29e8b39cedfbe31e171497e5c1bb03e4b90f4ba268d1b0da388b57058e767322",
      "words_sha256": "2d7454a9f90b17ffef34d92b365f3b3882e9a5dd1fd3a73267d09a53bb3f9840"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_00.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "54ca4302523ee1e2729e6a577685780c210e7d196c95093b7b6ba909b76fbe0e",
      "words_sha256": "aa5bfc619b39bee6787c193b999ff86acfdbf10898dbf660926587b74ef57699",
      "words_path": "voice_00.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8319c0176f106c95016561c38640455c",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "七月十二号，温网决赛最后一分。辛纳四盘赢下兹维列夫，卫冕冠军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_01.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "577787ce9f2abba92375a30afecb019265b450b168e39d9ee9dfd18298c26b3e",
      "words_sha256": "38576353d2053cbcc54f63d848ee62f0755405a078c245c543d00656cceff128",
      "words_path": "voice_01.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "f66518a5328578d6550448e6beff82e4",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "六月二十九号，对凯茨马诺维奇，第三盘二平，他滑倒了。有人回看说，这可能是后来右膝的起点。官方没有这么说。赛后他说，还好没事。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_02.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "2ff67739f203c1b643577e6bbda4b3b8dd7119956a588f56b05f8fc8ead27d99",
      "words_sha256": "4a9fbfede2500398a269051f4275b350739860499316219623bf84aa33bd7493",
      "words_path": "voice_02.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "dbd5f7f5309a8716b3e1f520469b0c1d",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "谁也没想到，这是他今年赛场上的最后一分。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_03.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "d0e761e12cad4be956d4a23e478853de630a48e52f9ce699b6b730f88529e0e9",
      "words_sha256": "15d6a810168ebcaf3c5f103cea16b442289ca01a0b8e416b7bdb1726427a902f",
      "words_path": "voice_03.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c6828347a233fd9800c99e275e30623e",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "那时他今年四十四胜三负，连拿五个大师赛冠军，是毫无争议的世界第一。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_04.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "8802303a17a87ea393de648a1d48a93643397bf455a8c0b48d6d5e1b90f409ad",
      "words_sha256": "8ec1e410c431c6055fbd8a4f9e827d8f1c83fb1d946370c6303d9e09dbcb1eeb",
      "words_path": "voice_04.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "1f98c02326810af85764e6d34dffb5de",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "温网后休完假，七月底他回到场上训练。意大利媒体报道，右膝就是这时候开始不舒服的。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_05.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "8026f51286945290207d78d9ba25365c8200ae828f115c0193e754975b76f058",
      "words_sha256": "58065de7bdb7112fb36a2449a0dd1fcd2a109838504f6c0e07ffd1af130504cf",
      "words_path": "voice_05.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "67536ee55e3bc38ded5e41abe09e443c",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "蒙特利尔、辛辛那提、美网，他一站接一站退赛。辛辛那提那次，他第一次公开提到：右膝一直在困扰我。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_06.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "ac93d2735afab462f3a11970cff1f46a6c3365d10eb24ab7d7bde40dac856a87",
      "words_sha256": "ebc5ed6a7fa2f44f612f5d7c8ede1df05e7675d54101eb4eb75acaeb617c66ec",
      "words_path": "voice_06.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8a8f9b2df59372d97e9c0cfefb26c34d",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "九月二十五号，他自己发视频，退出卫冕的中网。他说：膝盖还没到我想要的状态。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_07.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "896147475994d893ec15b57807089355ad5ee6ef3365f98fe407f08751b810da",
      "words_sha256": "682009c30a4c7d2b118d2e8d4de9dde99efe7b3202b351bd55ac35bf2c875a72",
      "words_path": "voice_07.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "270162cd7c20970a09417f93c42a5101",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "意大利媒体报道，九月底他本来准备飞上海，最后一刻膝盖又疼了。他转去法国里昂，找膝关节专家检查。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_08.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "2afcaf875b73adf6cfb305189caa2045eff853f8d5d9df45db38170df84f3aaa",
      "words_sha256": "4c92a0788108f253a1fc993dcdf8e34fb829402407202734a9d8a8954b0dd7a9",
      "words_path": "voice_08.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "872f15a50cb62c5f7e0af2f69a61b9f9",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "他自己说，有的日子一点感觉都没有，有的日子完全动不了。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_09.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "e55b04f6ef3971cfc934667aabaccaa41fd857d3d8eb27765bdc219ff6c2906a",
      "words_sha256": "b2f4128f6732aa02e1011668310233b5818891b4e66c2bff9779c9dbcd002a42",
      "words_path": "voice_09.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6f649b63139d15529d5273e35fcf9335",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "团队从没公布诊断，只说是右膝炎症。意大利媒体普遍报道，是髂胫束综合征：大腿外侧那条筋膜，在膝盖外侧反复摩擦发炎。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_10.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "137223440ae2a306463fa7d4d8ce7b6eff67af391c7af9874c5f8591aa380567",
      "words_sha256": "adef0e420930d77f320caabe0f73e523c0ee91e68b31d5aa69d9418a72f92b14",
      "words_path": "voice_10.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6299e9357408766cc6694653e912d241",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "当时专家的意见是：不用开刀，休息加保守治疗。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_11.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "b35a6dc781abd04ee595e7a4c9086d911a0ca94a08bad9512f5c1d8227cd73f0",
      "words_sha256": "1e5ecf7c161ba4a0f754db1ca28ab626436fa5ccc2f0c3b6d7d6238bc0af8af0",
      "words_path": "voice_11.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "eb3626beced50eb4f660e7172ffdf939",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "十月六号，他又发了一段视频。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_13.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "29e8b39cedfbe31e171497e5c1bb03e4b90f4ba268d1b0da388b57058e767322",
      "words_sha256": "2d7454a9f90b17ffef34d92b365f3b3882e9a5dd1fd3a73267d09a53bb3f9840",
      "words_path": "voice_13.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "9a78398c1675d64eae98ccd2498847ca",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这意味着，去年秋天维也纳、巴黎、年终总决赛三个冠军的积分，他一分都保不住。十一月二号，兹维列夫登上世界第一。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_14.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "a4c3ede582e6da2d9529f27b5e0b5ef65f9d7e5347854b46757319efb685a508",
      "words_sha256": "a2d61224f9275ea7f6c5b9f6284b3d8e149abe111705b9fecd59f151ecd629a7",
      "words_path": "voice_14.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "841acda47960495c2d045bb42e269308",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "辛纳退到第二。他在世界第一的位置上，一共待了九十五周。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_15.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "2e67be732425be2b9590d536b4f4df0ec279b0c9023056848d1248f15fcbc5ba",
      "words_sha256": "051d8213ba04c03706307720c81f91e1ace3937192944aa812938a7c06707c8a",
      "words_path": "voice_15.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a63eeaf1af3167866525e097aa5f9a69",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "更麻烦的是，养伤期间他又做了扁桃体切除手术，体重和肌肉都掉了不少。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_16.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "2b58c7c6c8b292995d8e5816821d8c7a47002494008ef9aa26c70207acddea5a",
      "words_sha256": "38c1557ba9c42ce46fb1cdf7716a83fe094dc56d26cb7d2983b09a1a3cc9de4f",
      "words_path": "voice_16.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "7608260318cf795ad01eb769d2f8e8d7",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "《米兰体育报》说，康复因此被打断，膝盖又疼了起来，几乎要从头再来。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_17.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "dbcd38399418c9b1136131fd142e5abf2d6d89f39060b6aea2df16305495507d",
      "words_sha256": "0bebcf305e27c6295dd04c7dd22aa8ca680a2418ff00ebc6f06734d4054b25e7",
      "words_path": "voice_17.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "3eaad1f924301586dce760e610ad821b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "十一月在米兰，他说：这是我第一次失去掌控，这种感觉我不喜欢。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_18.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "d8e85a107a8592b5a78fe6b17268341c8a376da31b583565973d895dd1514492",
      "words_sha256": "fe58959a740b57d8466d9af37e2c7d950c018c5d1542bcf6fc6c636d62d28293",
      "words_path": "voice_18.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b813d967d06d80bc49715131fe55a9d8",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "目标还是澳网。但他也说：一急，可能会出更严重的问题。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_19.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "f29de898d71951090f2ab4eca85f13eddce32dbef7d366874824b6d4685df8ce",
      "words_sha256": "87a46bc6ddaae5cfaaa2bd8e3358748143c8d81fcc158303536432fcff85f32c",
      "words_path": "voice_19.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "46c6c67c63a00eedc331a220522c10bb",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "保守治疗四个多月，还是没好。意大利媒体报道，十一月二十四号，他将在芬兰图尔库，由莱姆帕伊宁做手术。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_20.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "65647e9e416cb8ef0fedcd296fec4de4d0dd395be8ae65cb1030b56a4b7bc4a7",
      "words_sha256": "15ddaa5839d559ba08daaff7cfa81820e636eea2adfa280d7f1cbb05c99df612",
      "words_path": "voice_20.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ba9e527f030b8e7e70e7fefae02d6d3f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "报道里的伤，还是髂胫束和外侧半月板。具体开哪一刀，各家还不一致。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_21.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "8c50ccefcc60a425c5968a301342c7fe32373fb2c8b215627db5934ce629dbd9",
      "words_sha256": "56a1a38e3b176ec3a13877a22ef1f9cb9056ba8a0fdafed3abf6934a236f6b94",
      "words_path": "voice_21.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "66438c90edec9d6885ea3f4a5aef92b2",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "只要开刀，最少缺阵三个月，澳网基本赶不上。ATP 和他的团队，到今天还没有确认。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_22.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "cf5c6204c4bf5616abe04e25bdff3b3dea2c199a6d11fd739861f59aed16e3b7",
      "words_sha256": "46ace2a392d522a4996102689fd876042d05667bde6de947805ea40fe305c982",
      "words_path": "voice_22.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "62885ea32351f1d9bc65fee994693e23",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "他说过：长远，比眼前的胜利重要得多。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
